# No other faces or names

Hard rule for photos on diana’s dashboard (`/Users/diana/my-dashboard`), including page backgrounds, home/dashboard tiles, pursuit cards, and the backgrounds gallery.

**Related rules (do not weaken):**

- `section-images-real-photography` — section/zone look: real photography preferred; no faces; **silhouettes OK** (woman only)
- `rejected-section-photos-banned` — once rejected, never restore (candle, people on soul/darkness, etc.)
- `overview-no-cards` — depth layers on the **right** (sections · subsections · cards · tasks in the old overview/details slot); do not conflate cards with subsections
- `woman-silhouettes-only` — if a silhouette is used, it must read as a woman

## Forbidden (generated / found / curated images)

- Anybody else’s **face** (photos, portraits, reflections, crowd shots, stock models, skin/features that identify a person)
- Anybody else’s **name** (printed, handwritten, letterhead, name badges, author lines, signatures, watermarks, captions)

## Allowed

- **Woman silhouettes** — pure shadow / outline figures with **no face detail** (see `woman-silhouettes-only`)
- **Brand names she puts on a card** (e.g. Smile Set on the smile set card) — depict that brand by name; see `brand-named-cards`
- Diana’s own name / brand (e.g. Diana Jundi, Jundi Enterprises) when she asks for it
- Objects, places, documents, and scenes with **no** identifiable faces and **no** third-party names

## User-provided screenshots (hard exception)

When Diana sends an **actual screenshot** (email, Handshake, messages, documents, etc.):

- Use it **as-is**
- **Never** redact, crop out, blur, regenerate, or replace faces/names
- Do **not** apply the “no other faces or names” rule to those screenshots

That rule only applies to images she asks you to **find, create, or generate**.

## When generating or choosing images

- Prefer still-lifes, environments, or woman silhouettes — never photoreal faces
- If text appears on papers/signs, keep it generic (titles, topics) — never invent other researchers’ or authors’ names
- If an existing **generated/found** asset has another person’s name or face, do **not** use it live; archive it and replace
- Rejected section photos (candle soul, person-in-storm darkness, etc.) stay banned forever — see `rejected-section-photos-banned`

## Everything page — vision collage

Day cards from Aug 26 onward use **vision collage** (see `everything-vision-collage` rule): full-bleed photo **sections** in a collage, not cards with black footers.

## Research proposals context

Research proposals on this board are in **psychology**. Generated photos should support that without naming or showing other people’s faces.
